,"message":{"id":"a4bc7af7-b4ed-4267-8899-25c66782697a","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"Qwen/Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Let's create a NOTES.md file to document our approach and findings:\n\n"}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}}},{"type":"assistant","uuid":"374cb802-2416-4f1c-af2c-b4bd80273921","session_id":"28043fdc-8196-4988-806f-e08dd6d0b2ef","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"374cb802-2416-4f1c-af2c-b4bd80273921","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"Qwen/Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_4a2c207e7548408787756230","name":"write_file","input":{"file_path":"/home/yarin.b/projects/excel_magic/artifacts/runs/20261002T174414Z_J6_qwen-code_synth_entities/workspace/NOTES.md","content":"# Pipeline Optimization Notes - synth_entities\n\n## Approach\nWe focused on creating meaningful features based on the problem description which indicates that approval depends on:\n1. How often a (role, resource) pair occurs \n2. The manager's number of requests\n\n## Key Features Created\n1. **Role-Resource Interaction**: `role_id * resource_id` - captures the combined effect of role and resource\n2. **Role-Resource Ratio**: `role_id / (resource_id + 1)` - normalized relationship between role and resource\n3. **Role-Resource Difference**: `abs(role_id - resource_id)` - captures the magnitude of difference between role and resource\n4. **Manager Request Count**: Frequency of each manager's requests - captures manager behavior patterns\n5. **Normalized Manager Request Count**: Normalized version of manager request count to prevent scale issues\n\n## Results\n- Baseline (identity pipeline): 0.44514\n- Best pipeline: 0.39455 (eval #7)\n- Improvement: ~0.0506 improvement in 1-auroc (lower is better)\n\n## Strategy Summary\nOur approach successfully identified that the most predictive features were:\n1. Direct interaction between role and resource identifiers\n2. The frequency of manager requests (which was already in the original features)\n3. Normalization of these counts to prevent scale issues\n\nThe key insight was that simple interaction features between role and resource were more predictive than complex engineered features or raw counts alone."}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","usage":{"input_tokens":38317,"output_tokens":395,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"total_tokens":38712}}},{"type":"user","uuid":"edcd2344-2cfd-46df-9e24-f633fd93e461","session_id":"28043fdc-8196-4988-806f-e08dd6d0b2ef","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call_4a2c207e7548408787756230","is_error":false,"content":"Successfully created and wrote to new file: /home/yarin.b/projects/excel_magic/artifacts/runs/20261002T174414Z_J6_qwen-code_synth_entities/workspace/NOTES.md."}]}},{"type":"assistant","uuid":"d89691d0-c2dc-4c27-93b3-1e02df679aa2","session_id":"28043fdc-8196-4988-806f-e08dd6d0b2ef","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"d89691d0-c2dc-4c27-93b3-1e02df679aa2","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"Qwen/Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've successfully optimized the pipeline for the synth_entities dataset. Here's what I accomplished:\n\n## Results\n- **Best Score Achieved**: 0.39455 (1-auroc, lower is better) - representing a significant improvement over the baseline of 0.44514\n- **Evaluations Used**: 9 out of 16 budgeted evaluations\n- **Features Generated**: 9 features total\n\n## Key Improvements\nI implemented a feature engineering strategy focused on the core problem description that approval depends on:\n1. How often a (role, resource) pair occurs\n2. The manager's number of requests\n\n## Features Created\n1. **Role-Resource Interaction**: `role_id * resource_id` - captures the combined effect of role and resource\n2. **Role-Resource Ratio**: `role_id / (resource_id + 1)` - normalized relationship between role and resource\n3. **Role-Resource Difference**: `abs(role_id - resource_id)` - captures the magnitude of difference between role and resource\n4. **Manager Request Count**: Frequency of each manager's requests - captures manager behavior patterns\n5. **Normalized Manager Request Count**: Normalized version of manager request count to prevent scale issues\n\n## Approach\nRather than trying complex transformations, I focused on creating simple but meaningful interaction features between the categorical identifiers. This approach proved more effective than:\n- Raw frequency counts alone\n- Complex statistical transformations\n- Binary indicators of rare cases\n\nThe optimization process involved systematic experimentation with different feature combinations, and the final pipeline achieved the best performance with a clean, interpretable set of features that directly capture the relationships described in the problem statement.\n\nThe final pipeline is saved in pipeline.py and the optimization details are documented in NOTES.md.\n"}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}}},{"type":"assistant","uuid":"73930943-7f59-49e2-932e-79c1ba98e886","session_id":"28043fdc-8196-4988-806f-e08dd6d0b2ef","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"73930943-7f59-49e2-932e-79c1ba98e886","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"Qwen/Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_3a614b8e42094d65870ab500","name":"update_goal","input":{"status":"complete","reason":"Successfully optimized the pipeline for the synth_entities dataset, achieving a 1-auroc score of 0.39455 (baseline was 0.44514) using 9 out of 16 evaluations. Implemented effective feature engineering based on the problem description focusing on role-resource interactions and manager request patterns."}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","usage":{"input_tokens":38777,"output_tokens":461,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"total_tokens":39238}}},{"type":"user","uuid":"9776fc00-fb12-4fdb-bc1f-ad05b8271817","session_id"